                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "House Democrats have fought hard to make health care more affordable by lowering prescription drug costs and cutting premiums.\n\nBut these are patchwork solutions. It\u2019s time to ensure that everyone has access to the care they need through #MedicareForAll.",
