                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "It\u2019s been 2 years since Dobbs.\n\n21 states have banned abortion. Many have criminalized patients & providers. 1 in 3 women now live in states where their reproductive freedom is under attack, placing burdens on states like CA.\n\nWe must act to ensure access to repro care for all. https://t.co/SVnQY6Btk0",
