                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "On the 59th anniversary of Medicare & Medicaid, let's not forget: while Democrats work to expand coverage & lower costs, the House GOP proposed higher premiums & drug prices for Medicare and $4.5 trillion in cuts to the ACA, Medicaid, & the Children\u2019s Health Insurance Program.",
