                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Project 2025 threatens to make the Thurmans\u2019 nightmare a reality for too many more families.\n\nAmber Thurman should be raising her son and helping her patients today. In her name, we must work to restore and enhance reproductive care nationwide.",
