                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "On Medicaid Day of Action, I hosted a roundtable with patients and providers to discuss the impacts of Republican healthcare cuts on CA-37, which ranks 4th in the nation for Medicaid enrollment.\n\nMedicaid shouldn't be partisan\u2014it helps people in both blue and red districts. We must continue to share our stories and tell the truth about this life-saving program.",
