                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "15 years ago, President Obama signed the Affordable Care Act into law, lowering healthcare costs for millions of Americans.\n\nHouse Republicans just voted to increase ACA marketplace premiums by $2,020 a year.\n\nThe Affordable Care Act saves lives\u2014I'll always fight to protect it. https://t.co/XkfVQ4LLJG",
