                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Over 400K of my constituents rely on Medicaid.\n\nTrump & Republicans' Medicaid cuts would reduce or cancel coverage for millions\u2014forcing places like St. John's Avalon Health & Access Center to close.\n\nI talked to @sjhealthca\u2019s President & CEO about the ripple effect of these cuts. https://t.co/1I233OoP9M",
