                "reply_count": 5,
                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "So many Angelenos lost everything in the LA fires simply because home insurance wasn\u2019t available to them.\n\u00a0\nAs the climate crisis causes more disasters, @SenAdamSchiff & I introduced a bill to ensure that insurance companies don\u2019t exclude vulnerable communities from coverage.",
